<.timeline_entry
  logo="/images/remote-logo.jpg"
  logo_alt="Remote logo"
  link="https://remote.com/"
  title="Remote"
  role="Senior Backend Engineer"
  start_date={~D[2023-07-01]}
  highlights={[
    "One of the main contributors to the billing area",
    "Led the migration of a large part of the costs to a new external billing provider",
    "Lead the resolution of incidents during billing days and guide my teammates' technical work"
  ]}
  details_id="more-information-remote"
  details={[
    "I joined Remote as a Backend Engineer in the fintech area of the company, as part of the billing team, and I have become one of the main contributors to the billing area. I contributed to several projects, such as:",
    "<ul>",
    "<li><b>Migration to a new external billing provider</b>: As part of this migration, I:",
    "<ul>",
    "<li>Led the migration of a large part of the costs to the new approach, untangling how the legacy system worked in order to precisely recreate the new cost components.</li>",
    "<li>Led the creation of automation workflows that allowed us to transition from a manually supervised workflow to an automated one.</li>",
    "</ul>",
    "</li>",
    "<li><b>Standardisation of FX rates</b>: Built a standardised approach where the same FX rates are applied throughout a whole billing cycle. It also adds traceability for FX rates and FX spreads.</li>",
    "</ul>",
    "Beyond these projects, my responsibilities include:",
    "<ul>",
    "<li><b>Technical guidance</b>: Supervising my teammates' work and providing high-level insights before a solution is implemented.</li>",
    "<li><b>Billing-day incidents</b>: Leading the resolution of incidents during billing days, which have hard deadlines and require a fast, effective response.</li>",
    "</ul>"
  ]}
>
